Purpose: production TEST rollout of hardened Google Drive resumable archive v16 plus WB Advertising M0 read-only tools and coverage-gated WB Semantic Core, retaining Yandex Object Storage for durable queue/staging and backup.
Architecture contract: annual dataset CSV files and reports registry are authoritative on Google Drive; Yandex Object Storage stores job state, immutable candidates, staging/resume state and a byte-for-byte backup; the Apps Script bridge secret is stored in Yandex Lockbox; no Google OAuth refresh token is stored in Yandex.
Semantic contract: marketplace_business_query receives the original natural-language question; only explicitly approved WB weekly-finance capabilities may execute, FULL_COVERAGE is mandatory, currencies and unrelated financial components are never silently combined, and current-state/complete-orders/Ozon/unknown concepts fail closed.
Large-file contract: Apps Script brokers official Google Drive API resumable-session creation; Yandex uploads bounded chunks directly to a deterministic non-canonical staging filename, trusts Drive-confirmed offsets, verifies exact size + Drive SHA256, writes the byte-for-byte Yandex backup, then uses archive-root-scoped promote_verified to replace canonical. Large annual CSVs are never transported through Apps Script as one base64 POST.
Recovery contract: unusable non-rate-limit 4xx resumable sessions restart from the immutable candidate; ambiguous 408/5xx query the Drive-confirmed offset before resend; rate limits use bounded backoff/Retry-After; resumable session URIs are bearer-like and must never be logged or returned.
Diagnostic contract: before the existing Laser Master candidate may replace the canonical annual file, the same candidate is uploaded to a temporary Drive filename, verified by exact size + Drive SHA256, then trashed; this diagnostic must not call WB, repeat PREPARE, advance completed_count, or move the durable phase out of UPLOAD_ANNUAL.
Production overlays: preserve the multi-dataset data catalog/routing, runtime service-account archive authentication and other runtime hardening already present in this vendored snapshot; Advertising M0 and Semantic Core are layered on top rather than replacing those controls.
Advertising contract: WB only in this phase; live campaign state comes from Promotion API using dedicated server-side wb_ads credentials; advertising-attribution metrics are not actual business profit; Advertising Archive V1 category scaffold exists on Drive for all three WB cabinets but ingestion/coverage/registry integration is not yet accepted.
Security contract: Promotion start/pause/stop are WRITE and delete is DESTRUCTIVE at MCP level even though WB exposes them as HTTP GET operations. M0 exposes only read-only advertising business tools.
Source acceptance: archive/runtime base remains the hardened Drive resumable v16 snapshot; Semantic Core corrections were merged to marketplaces-mcp-ru main as 920f3f1458a1700ad350d43cf35178256e8e858f after Linux/Windows CI plus security/dependency/supply-chain PASS.
